		{
			dependencies: ["4058D1416D94BABB"]
			description: [
				"The Alloy Blast Smelter outputs fluids (the corresponding products can be made with the Mixer - Electric Blast Furnace or with Carbon Disulfide) and molten fluids. Molten fluids need to be cooled in a Vacuum Freezer."
				""
				"Do not be scared off by the long smelting time: it is the result of folding the Mixer's recipe directly into the smelting recipe, and it is actually faster than mixing and then smelting the dust in the blast furnace (Stainless Steel, for example)."
				""
				"Almost every alloy material can be produced in this machine, so if you have trouble finding an alloy recipe, look for the &b&lmolten fluid&r!"
			]
			icon: "gtceu:alloy_blast_smelter"
			icon_scale: 1.3d
			id: "1F0956C3BD4745A1"
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 2.0d
