		{
			dependencies: ["1F0956C3BD4745A1"]
			description: [
				"You can now make large versions of single-block machines, which boost voltage and overclock better and give you higher parallelism."
				""
				"Machines whose description contains &eallows the machine to process multiple identical recipes at once via the Parallel Control Hatch&r can have a Parallel Control Hatch installed."
				""
				"Do not forget to install Parallel Control Hatches on your earlier machines (Desulfurizer, Fishing Ground, Large Greenhouse, etc.)."
				""
				"Parallel Hatches can be &bshared"
				""
				"{\"text\": \"You can go here to see how many large versions of single-block machines there are in total\",  \"italic\":\"true\",\"underlined\": \"true\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"1443E064A0AB0B8B\" } }"
