			description: [
				"Essential; do not forget to place the Energy Hatch."
				""
				"Higher temperatures generate more power, while lower temperatures are mainly for producing resources."
				""
				"Please read the controller's text description carefully."
				""
				"If the fission reactor's damage reaches 100%, it will cause an explosion with a radius of 11 chunks * 11 chunks."
