		{
			dependencies: ["27BA6EBA81622516"]
			description: [
				"Simply put, it lets machines take items straight from the ME Network and use them."
				""
				"Left-click with a &dData Stick&r to save the hatch's configuration, right-click to apply the configuration"
				""
				"You can enable &6auto-pull mode&r to automatically pull stocked items/fluids from the network (&btag buses can be set to a pull sorting mode&r)."
				""
				"Right-click an ME hatch with &dWire Cutters&r to toggle the ME hatch between connecting to the network from the front and connecting from any side"
				""
				"You can adjust the &6pull interval&r at the bottom left of the hatch GUI; by default it shows 0tick, which means the pull interval is not changed, with &ba minimum of 1tick&r (this affects the speed of pulling from the ME Network)"
				""
				"You can enable &dextreme pull mode&r in gtlcore's config file, so that the &6ME Dual Hatch Stock Part Machine&r pulls with no delay (this affects parallel calculation), though it may have some impact on TPS."
				""
				"Tag stock buses are used in the same way as tag storage buses."
				""
				"Note: because AE needs to re-form the network when entering a save, stocking hatches will be disconnected from the network for a very short period of time."
				"Multiple stocking input hatches/buses in the same multiblock cannot be tagged with the same content."
			]
